:false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hst"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3117c80d-86f2-4bc6-a843-f03884c93216","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"決定木の可視化方法だと思えば便利そう（そうか？）","ts":"1633701326.058900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YoTlg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fde33cb-24b4-47ba-a3fc-a594ba164c1d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"役に立つものならそのうち説得力のある説明がいろいろ出てくるでしようし","ts":"1633701103.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gpKu9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65483582-4303-4b25-95c7-1c4302139c6c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まあ論文になってないようですし（ブログ記事だし）、今の段階であんまり批判的に読まなくても良い気がしますね","ts":"1633701061.057100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C4g9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dae74f2-2a24-41e5-a1c5-8319196f0a30","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"決定木による回帰って木の深さ（ノード数）によって性能が大きく変化するはずで、そのノード数はどうやって決めるんだろうか。\n記事に書かれている限りはクロスバリデーションによって最適なノード数を決定するのかなと読めるけど、クロスバリデーションをする際のデータの分割方法とかがよく分からない。ランダムに選んだりするのかな。そこにランダム性があるとスコアは一意に定まらなくなるのだけど","ts":"1633699262.054900","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1633699280.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XrfNU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4349ea7c-bb0a-4ff5-b252-af880d004537","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"相関係数よりは重い計算だけど非線形回帰ほどめんどくさくなくてパッと見分かりやすいよ的な指標になっているのかな","ts":"1633699125.053200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kufh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b4718dc-c427-4e8e-94a6-4c0a374abf14","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"回帰分析にも慣れてないマンなので誰か統計屋に解説して欲しい","ts":"1633699084.051900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JDEe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03a8afbe-c356-4c0b-9339-2008ad127665","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"よく考えたら、比較対象って相関係数じゃなくて非線形回帰であるべきでは","ts":"1633698974.051000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jEXh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2eaa68c-3bc9-4270-ae15-bb6138142cf0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"たぶん元記事の翻訳だと思われるものをみつけた","ts":"1633698146.049900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXf0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"379357a9-8baf-483f-8cfe-3b9b846e8646","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://ichi.pro/rip-sokan-yosoku-pawa-sukoa-no-shokai-67690841216408|https://ichi.pro/rip-sokan-yosoku-pawa-sukoa-no-shokai-67690841216408\u003e","ts":"1633698132.049300","attachments":[{"fallback":"ICHI.PRO: RIP相関。予測パワースコアの紹介","id":1,"title":"RIP相関。予測パワースコアの紹介","title_link":"https://ichi.pro/rip-sokan-yosoku-pawa-sukoa-no-shokai-67690841216408","text":"Predictive Power Score（PPS）を定義し、オープンソース化します。PPSは、データ内でより多くのパターンを見つける相関の代替手段です。","image_url":"https://ichi.pro/assets/images/max/724/1*XOC9DQ6rJMdNE4-_fUo6kw.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"ICHI.PRO","service_icon":"https://ichi.pro/favicons/ichi/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://ichi.pro/rip-sokan-yosoku-pawa-sukoa-no-shokai-67690841216408","original_url":"https://ichi.pro/rip-sokan-yosoku-pawa-sukoa-no-shokai-67690841216408"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZB5Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31117d1f-a30e-44f1-bee1-d16244171e5f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"統計分析わからんマンなのでこれの雰囲気もよくわからん感が強い","ts":"1633697981.049100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T0LNb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"801108be-0a2b-4984-9f68-16c08cd679b6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"スコアっていう名称でいいのか？感","ts":"163369782